          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma dwe me abiro oromo, onoŋo jo Icrael doŋ gitye i gaŋigi. Ci lwak gucokke ki cwiny acel i dyekal ma i nyim Dogcel me Pii; ci gutito bot Ejira ma lapwony-cik pa Lubaŋa ni okel buk me cik pa Moses ma yam Lubaŋa omiyo bot jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Ejira okelo buk me cik i nyim cokke, ma tye iye co ki mon ki jo ducu ma yam giromo winyone ki niaŋ iye maber, i nino dwe mukwoŋo me dwe me abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejira ocako kwanone i nyimgi, kun ocuŋ okemo dyekal ma i nyim Dogcel me Pii-ni, ocako kwanone odiko nio wa dyeceŋ, kun kwano i nyim co ki mon ducu ki jo ma gitwero niaŋ lokke maber, kun dano ducu guciko itgi ka winyo lok ma i buk me cik, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejira ma lapwony-cik pa Lubaŋa ocuŋ i wi abam bao ma gitiyo pi kwano lok meno, Jo magi yam gucuŋ ka ŋete tuŋ lacuc, Matitia, Cema, Anaya, Uria, Ilkia, ki Maceya; ka dok jo magi gucuŋ ka ŋete tuŋ lacam, Pedaya, Micael, Malkija, Kacum, Kacbadana, Jekaria, ki Meculam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma Ejira ocuŋ malo ka maleŋ i kabedo me kwano buk, lwak ducu guciko waŋgi i kome, Oyabo buk ci dano ducu gua malo gucuŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ejira okwoŋo ki pwoyo Rwot, Lubaŋa madit; ci lwak ducu gugamo ni, “Amen, Amen,” kun giriŋo ciŋgi malo; ka dok guryebbe piny, ci guworo Rwot ma gukulo wigi piny i ŋom, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok lwak gucuŋ i kabedogi, ci Lulevi magi: Yecwa, Bani, Cerebia, Jamin, Akub, Cebetai, Kodia, Maceya, Kelita, Ajaria, Jojabad, Kanan, ki Pelaya, gukonyo lwak me niaŋ te cik maber, kun onoŋo lwak gubedo i kabedogi mot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gukwano lok me cik nia ki i buk me cik, en aye buk me cik pa Lubaŋa, dok gugonyo te lokke matir bot lwak, wek guniaŋ lok ma gikwano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka lwak doŋ guwinyo lok ma gikwano ki i buk me cik, gucako koko cut. Ci Nekemia ma onoŋo en laloc, ki Ejira ma onoŋo ajwaka dok bene lapwony-cik pa Lubaŋa, kacel ki Lulevi ma gupwonyo lwak guwaco bot lwak ni, “Man aye nino maleŋ bot Rwot Lubaŋawa; pe wukum dok bene pe wukoki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok owaco botgi ni, “Doŋ wuwot, wucit wucam moo ki wumat koŋo vino maliŋo, wucwal cam mogo bot dano mo ma pe ki cam; pien tin aye nino maleŋ bot Rwotwa; pien yomcwiny pa Rwot en aye tek mewu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lulevi gujuko dano guliŋ mot, kun giwacci “Wubed mot laliŋ, pien man aye nino maleŋ; pe wubed ki cwercwiny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak guket gucito i gaŋigi ka cam ki ka mat, dok gucwalo cam mogo ma gitye kwede bot luwotgi mukene, pi bedo ki yomcwiny madwoŋ, pien guwinyo lok ma gikwano gitito botgi ci guniaŋ maber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
