                "loc": "DEU.16.13+DEU.16.14+DEU.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 16.13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci gunoŋo ka ma gicoyo i buk me cik ni Rwot yam ociko Moses ni jo Icrael myero gubed i bolo pi kwero nino madito me dwe me abirone, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dok myero guywek lokke wek gutit i gaŋigi ducu ki i Jerucalem, kun giwacci, “Wucit i wi godi ka kela jaŋ jeituni, ki jeituni ma i tim, ki yadi ma ŋwecgi kur, yat otit ki yadi ma potgi oluk wek wayub bolo mapol, kit ma gicoyo i buk me cik.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak ducu gucito ka kelo jami ma gitito pire-ni ci gutiyo bolo mapol me bedogi, kun dano acel acel timo mere, i wi odigi, i dyekalgi, ki i dyekal me ot pa Lubaŋa, ki i dyekal ma i Dogcel me Pii, ki i dyekal ma i dogcel ma gilwoŋo ni pa Epraim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki cokke pa lwak ma con gudwogo ki i opii i rok mukene gutiyo bologi ci gubedo iye; cakke i kare pa Yocwa wod pa Nun nio kwede wa i nino meno jo Icrael pe gutiyo kit meno. Ci gubedo ki yomcwiny madit twatwal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok nino ki nino gikwano lok ma tye i buk me cik pa Lubaŋa i kom nino mukwoŋo nio kwede wa i nino me agikkine. Gukwero nino me cokke maleŋ pi nino abiro; i kom nino me aborone ci gubedo ki cokke maleŋ, ma lubo cik kikome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
